======================================================================
 Dario Store: "Report a problem" on a closed chat
 Date:     2026-09-26 02:41:04 CET
 Branch:   main @ 2122439 (changes not committed yet)
======================================================================

SUMMARY
  When the team has closed an order's chat, the customer sees "Report a problem" under it.
  Picking a reason and writing a message reopens the chat, puts that message in it and emails
  the admins. Allowed for 30 days after delivery (no limit while the order is still on its way),
  at most once every 24 hours. After that, the closed chat shows the shop's contact channels.
  Tests: 242 passed in 20 files (16 new). Typecheck, lint, build pass. Checked live in a browser.

======================================================================
RULES (all enforced on the server, in MessageService.reportProblem)
======================================================================
  who          only the order's owner (staff, admins, other customers, guests: errors.writeDenied)
  when         only when the TEAM closed the chat; an open chat -> errors.chatAlreadyOpen,
               a cancelled order -> errors.chatClosed (unchanged: stays closed)
  window       PROBLEM_REPORT_DAYS = 30 after deliveredAt (src/lib/store.ts, one number to change);
               no window while the order is not delivered yet
  limit        once per 24 h (Order.problemReportedAt); errors.problemWait before that
  reason       one of NOT_WORKING, WRONG_ITEM, MISSING, OTHER (src/lib/problems.ts)
  message      required, 1000 characters max
  double click OrderRepository.reopenForProblem is a compare-and-swap on "chat still closed":
               only the first click reopens, writes the message and sends the email
  chat message "Problem reported: <reason>" + the customer's text, labelled in the order's
               language (like the other system messages)
  email        to the admins (ADMIN_NOTIFY_EMAIL or admin accounts), in English, with the reason
               but NOT the message text (chat text stays only in the encrypted chat)

